WEBVTT

00:01:26.560 --> 00:01:27.650
Are you all right?

00:01:27.650 --> 00:01:28.770
Yeah.

00:01:29.700 --> 00:01:31.270
Of course not!

00:01:35.310 --> 00:01:36.530
Sorry.

00:01:38.460 --> 00:01:40.530
Where did he go?

00:01:46.790 --> 00:01:49.340
Mister!

00:01:50.570 --> 00:01:51.900
Watch out!

00:01:59.610 --> 00:02:17.590
Mister!

00:02:24.900 --> 00:02:28.960
Still alive, eh?  You're as tenacious as ever!

00:02:28.960 --> 00:02:34.200
Even if everything down here has been destroyed, there's still another way.  Up above ground.

00:02:34.200 --> 00:02:38.090
When I applied them earlier, I already verified the parameters were correct.

00:02:38.090 --> 00:02:42.490
It's just a matter of time before I manually adjust the disconnected towers.

00:02:43.140 --> 00:02:45.970
So you plan to change all of Tokyo into light?

00:02:47.330 --> 00:02:49.500
No, what I'm changing is history.

00:02:58.060 --> 00:02:59.920
Mister, you've been injured.

00:03:02.350 --> 00:03:04.830
I've got to put an end to this now.

00:03:07.830 --> 00:03:09.970
Let's get going, Chiko.

00:03:09.970 --> 00:03:12.560
There are more things hiding unseen in the darkness.

00:03:14.710 --> 00:03:16.630
Block the exits!

00:03:16.630 --> 00:03:18.500
Don't let even a single rat escape!

00:03:20.160 --> 00:03:23.730
Please make absolutely sure the professor does not escape.

00:03:23.730 --> 00:03:24.420
Yes, sir!

00:03:29.570 --> 00:03:31.290
Are you two all right?

00:03:31.290 --> 00:03:32.480
Akechi-san!

00:03:33.370 --> 00:03:36.320
Looks like you won again.

00:03:36.320 --> 00:03:37.250
Where's that professor?

00:03:37.940 --> 00:03:38.940
He snuck out already.

00:03:40.450 --> 00:03:41.740
What about Twenty Faces?

00:03:43.500 --> 00:03:45.840
Huh?  He was just standing right here.

00:03:47.490 --> 00:03:50.420
And he's been injured too.

00:03:50.420 --> 00:03:52.610
Ouch.

00:03:52.610 --> 00:03:53.830
Are you all right?

00:03:53.830 --> 00:03:57.780
Yeah.  Somehow when I calmed down, I suddenly started feeling it.

00:04:00.010 --> 00:04:02.880
You there, I need you to do something for me.

00:04:08.880 --> 00:04:11.650
Come on, it's time for you two to leave this place.

00:04:11.650 --> 00:04:14.140
This officer will escort you to the surface.

00:04:14.140 --> 00:04:15.250
Shall we go?

00:04:15.250 --> 00:04:15.860
OK.

00:04:40.890 --> 00:04:42.160
Twenty Faces!

00:04:46.270 --> 00:04:47.560
Is that you, Akechi-kun?

00:04:50.650 --> 00:04:52.080
I've finally caught up.

00:04:52.720 --> 00:04:55.480
With you and with that professor's plot.

00:04:56.840 --> 00:04:59.940
Since it's you, you should already know...

00:04:59.940 --> 00:05:02.440
That whatever the professor's planning to do...

00:05:04.400 --> 00:05:06.250
He's not done yet.

00:05:06.250 --> 00:05:07.950
I will stop him.

00:05:10.190 --> 00:05:12.670
There is something you can do as well.

00:05:18.250 --> 00:05:22.590
I'll let you go for now, but, the next time I see you,

00:05:22.590 --> 00:05:24.890
I'm definitely taking you in.

00:05:37.840 --> 00:05:40.830
Don't leave the car until Akechi-san returns.

00:05:40.830 --> 00:05:41.900
It's too dangerous.

00:05:41.900 --> 00:05:42.670
OK.

00:05:47.380 --> 00:05:50.880
So, you're going after him, right?  Twenty Faces.

00:05:51.330 --> 00:05:53.610
I'm totally fine.

00:05:53.610 --> 00:05:55.330
A scratch like this is no big deal.

00:05:55.330 --> 00:05:56.830
Koito-san...

00:06:00.670 --> 00:06:03.330
I'll take care of this.  You get going.

00:06:03.330 --> 00:06:04.390
Huh?

00:06:04.390 --> 00:06:06.110
That's an order from your leader.

00:06:06.110 --> 00:06:07.840
The leader of the Detective Girls.

00:06:09.710 --> 00:06:13.300
Excuse me, my arm is really hurting.

00:06:13.300 --> 00:06:15.460
Could you get me a first-aid kit?

00:06:15.460 --> 00:06:16.110
Where?

00:06:16.110 --> 00:06:20.340
Ow-ow-ow-ow...

00:06:24.170 --> 00:06:25.140
Did something–

00:06:25.140 --> 00:06:26.880
Ah, it hurts, it hurts!

00:06:26.880 --> 00:06:28.830
I feel like I'm gonna die!

00:06:28.830 --> 00:06:32.290
W-Wait right here!  I'll get you a doctor.

00:06:34.530 --> 00:06:37.350
In that case, please excuse me as well.

00:06:42.880 --> 00:06:45.050
What's going on?

00:06:45.050 --> 00:06:46.760
Did something happen?

00:06:46.760 --> 00:06:50.610
Mommy!  Mom–

00:06:55.840 --> 00:06:59.270
There, there.  I'll go look for your mother.

00:06:59.270 --> 00:07:01.790
Miyo-chan!  Miyo-chan!

00:07:03.390 --> 00:07:04.980
Mommy!

00:07:07.280 --> 00:07:10.030
Oh, thank heavens!  You were right here.

00:07:10.030 --> 00:07:12.200
Come on, let's go.

00:07:15.840 --> 00:07:17.790
Where's the young lady?

00:07:25.790 --> 00:07:29.330
I've got to find out what happened over there.

00:07:33.010 --> 00:07:35.610
Pardon me.  Excuse me.

00:07:37.310 --> 00:07:38.010
Wh-What's this?

00:07:53.410 --> 00:07:54.660
It's horrible.

00:07:54.660 --> 00:07:56.920
It's a new type of bomb!

00:07:56.920 --> 00:07:58.200
It's war!

00:07:58.200 --> 00:07:59.780
The war's started again!

00:07:59.780 --> 00:08:03.670
No!

00:08:03.670 --> 00:08:06.420
I can't go through that terrible experience again!

00:08:06.420 --> 00:08:09.340
Absolutely not.  No!  No!

00:08:22.350 --> 00:08:25.480
What do you think?  I'd say it's my masterpiece.

00:08:25.480 --> 00:08:27.490
Listen up!

00:08:27.490 --> 00:08:32.520
Tomorrow morning, I, Twenty Faces, will steal Tokyo!

00:08:32.520 --> 00:08:35.880
Twenty Faces?  He's still alive?

00:08:42.270 --> 00:08:44.290
Listen up!

00:08:44.290 --> 00:08:48.910
Tomorrow morning, I, Twenty Faces, will steal Tokyo!

00:08:48.910 --> 00:08:52.110
Twenty Faces?  He's still alive?

00:08:56.280 --> 00:08:58.160
How could he steal Tokyo?

00:08:58.160 --> 00:09:00.810
He's planning to obliterate Tokyo!

00:09:00.810 --> 00:09:03.870
It's Twenty Faces!  He came to destroy Tokyo!

00:09:05.290 --> 00:09:06.290
No...

00:09:07.000 --> 00:09:07.730
That's not–

00:09:07.730 --> 00:09:09.000
That's not the Boss.

00:09:09.970 --> 00:09:11.840
Tomorrow morning!

00:09:11.840 --> 00:09:16.120
Tomorrow morning, I, Twenty Faces, will change history!

00:09:16.120 --> 00:09:18.440
Are we just going to let him walk all over us?

00:09:18.440 --> 00:09:20.200
Kill Twenty Faces!

00:09:20.200 --> 00:09:22.170
Damn him...

00:09:22.170 --> 00:09:23.680
Kill him!

00:09:25.400 --> 00:09:26.490
No!

00:09:26.490 --> 00:09:27.930
That's not–

00:09:29.920 --> 00:09:32.170
You're... Mikamo Chizuko?

00:09:33.670 --> 00:09:35.360
Twenty Faces'...

00:09:35.360 --> 00:09:37.180
The Daughter of Twenty Faces!

00:09:37.180 --> 00:09:38.860
It's Mikamo Chizuko!

00:09:38.860 --> 00:09:41.870
It's her!  One of Twenty Faces' gang is here!

00:09:41.870 --> 00:09:42.870
Get her!

00:09:42.870 --> 00:09:46.940
Twenty Faces will have to stop if we capture this little girl.

00:09:46.940 --> 00:09:49.970
Capture her!

00:09:50.100 --> 00:09:51.230
Get her!

00:09:55.390 --> 00:09:57.900
Look at them scatter away from the rift.

00:10:02.660 --> 00:10:06.240
Ah-ah!  Which way should we go?

00:10:06.240 --> 00:10:10.380
Young lady!

00:10:10.380 --> 00:10:11.810
Tome-san?

00:10:13.180 --> 00:10:14.480
Tome-san!

00:10:15.210 --> 00:10:18.470
Miss Shunka!  What are you doing here?

00:10:18.470 --> 00:10:20.340
Might you have come with the young lady?

00:10:20.890 --> 00:10:21.990
Oh!

00:10:22.770 --> 00:10:26.980
I'm sure she's on her way to be with Twenty Faces.

00:10:36.610 --> 00:10:38.490
There's no escape now.

00:10:38.490 --> 00:10:40.980
Prepare yourself, you scoundrel!

00:10:40.980 --> 00:10:44.400
We're going to lure Twenty Faces out with you as a hostage.

00:10:44.400 --> 00:10:46.570
Everyone's panicking out of fear.

00:10:46.570 --> 00:10:47.870
What should I do?

00:11:02.280 --> 00:11:03.520
It should be this way.

00:11:03.520 --> 00:11:05.260
Ah-ah, this is terrible.

00:11:06.650 --> 00:11:07.660
You know...

00:11:08.560 --> 00:11:12.560
I wonder if she's all right by herself?

00:11:12.560 --> 00:11:17.280
She's fine.  She's our ace after all.

00:11:17.280 --> 00:11:20.180
They said they caught the daughter of Twenty Faces by the river.

00:11:20.180 --> 00:11:21.110
Over there!

00:11:21.110 --> 00:11:22.310
The young lady!

00:11:23.270 --> 00:11:25.420
Ah-ah, what's this all about?

00:11:25.420 --> 00:11:26.550
I'm going!

00:11:26.550 --> 00:11:29.080
Ah-ah-ah!  Ah, ah-ah-ah!

00:11:31.550 --> 00:11:33.610
His voice was coming from around here.

00:11:33.610 --> 00:11:34.290
Yes.

00:11:35.450 --> 00:11:36.090
Ken.

00:11:50.340 --> 00:11:51.060
It's him.

00:11:57.950 --> 00:11:59.840
You asshole, where's Chiko?!

00:12:20.260 --> 00:12:21.760
You damn monster!

00:12:24.510 --> 00:12:25.590
Behind you!

00:12:39.850 --> 00:12:41.210
That body?

00:12:41.890 --> 00:12:44.200
It's one of your team's inventions.

00:12:45.480 --> 00:12:49.270
Just as that body of yours has already demonstrated,

00:12:49.270 --> 00:12:52.950
what we're doing now is welcoming a new dawn of science.

00:12:54.960 --> 00:12:56.840
Watch carefully.

00:12:56.840 --> 00:12:59.510
There's no night that doesn't end in a dawn.

00:13:05.720 --> 00:13:06.860
I can't let him get away.

00:13:24.650 --> 00:13:27.660
Do these guys not feel pain either?

00:13:31.740 --> 00:13:33.160
Just maybe...

00:13:35.390 --> 00:13:37.830
I'm sure of it.  These two are...

00:13:44.320 --> 00:13:45.380
Ken!

00:13:45.380 --> 00:13:47.090
Don't just stand there!

00:13:52.390 --> 00:13:54.000
Damn!  Hold it!

00:13:54.000 --> 00:13:55.340
Where's Chiko?!

00:13:59.410 --> 00:14:01.920
That pitiful girl...

00:14:01.920 --> 00:14:06.630
She's probably fallen victim to some mob, terror-stricken over Twenty Faces.

00:14:07.100 --> 00:14:07.610
What?

00:14:09.110 --> 00:14:09.910
Wait!

00:14:21.650 --> 00:14:23.730
I need to tend to your wounds.

00:14:23.730 --> 00:14:25.330
This sucks!

00:14:25.330 --> 00:14:27.460
We can't do anything.

00:14:27.460 --> 00:14:30.090
But, I did learn one important thing.

00:14:31.530 --> 00:14:33.680
They have a weak spot.

00:14:39.270 --> 00:14:41.050
Good job.

00:14:41.050 --> 00:14:43.740
Heh, we should use our secret weapon, too.

00:14:55.330 --> 00:14:57.370
What a dreadful thing.

00:14:57.370 --> 00:14:59.750
With this, he can kill hundreds in one shot...

00:14:59.750 --> 00:15:02.350
Capture the Daughter of Twenty Faces!

00:15:02.830 --> 00:15:04.630
Unhand me, you jerk!

00:15:04.630 --> 00:15:07.370
We had the Daughter of Twenty Faces cornered!

00:15:17.430 --> 00:15:19.260
These are the girl's clothes.

00:15:19.260 --> 00:15:20.870
She must be close by.

00:15:20.870 --> 00:15:22.000
Look for her!

00:15:22.000 --> 00:15:23.080
Yeah!

00:15:23.080 --> 00:15:25.770
Search!  Search!

00:15:31.490 --> 00:15:33.740
Damn it, where did she go?

00:15:39.430 --> 00:15:42.210
I can't believe terror could change people so much.

00:15:44.920 --> 00:15:48.920
Twenty Faces might also be unable to escape from the terrors of the war.

00:16:01.580 --> 00:16:07.540
It's just a matter of time before I manually adjust the disconnected towers.

00:16:09.360 --> 00:16:11.410
Let's get going, Chiko.

00:16:11.410 --> 00:16:14.180
There are more things hiding unseen in the darkness.

00:16:17.730 --> 00:16:20.200
I've got to go there.

00:16:23.210 --> 00:16:23.750
Stop it!  Stop it, please!

00:16:23.750 --> 00:16:25.710
You're harboring the Daughter of Twenty Faces, aren't you?!

00:16:27.210 --> 00:16:28.960
Someone save me!

00:16:32.960 --> 00:16:35.310
They've completely lost their minds.

00:16:35.310 --> 00:16:36.590
There she is!

00:16:36.590 --> 00:16:38.810
It's the Daughter of Twenty Faces!

00:16:38.810 --> 00:16:40.350
She's getting away.  After her!

00:16:44.350 --> 00:16:46.470
Hold it!

00:16:54.320 --> 00:16:56.620
There's no getting away now, girlie!

00:16:56.620 --> 00:16:58.460
It's time to give it up.

00:16:59.450 --> 00:17:00.930
Hold it!

00:17:08.690 --> 00:17:11.810
I can't stop!  I have to get to Twenty Faces!

00:17:25.730 --> 00:17:26.830
Found her!

00:17:28.480 --> 00:17:30.630
This is as far as you get.

00:17:37.370 --> 00:17:38.590
Got her!

00:17:41.590 --> 00:17:42.580
Damn you...

00:17:47.540 --> 00:17:49.830
Twenty Faces isn't stealing Tokyo!

00:17:52.110 --> 00:17:53.320
She jumped!

00:17:53.320 --> 00:17:54.090
She's falling.

00:17:56.590 --> 00:17:58.360
Don't let her get away!

00:18:03.600 --> 00:18:05.730
Don't let her get away this time.

00:18:05.730 --> 00:18:06.600
After her!

00:18:19.320 --> 00:18:22.620
I'm not scared.  I'm used to this from the circus.

00:18:23.560 --> 00:18:25.920
It's the Daughter of Twenty Faces!

00:18:25.920 --> 00:18:27.620
She's walking on air!

00:18:34.130 --> 00:18:36.730
I'm fine.  I'll make it.

00:18:40.200 --> 00:18:42.640
I'll help Twenty Faces.

00:18:56.950 --> 00:18:58.320
Damn it.

00:19:03.200 --> 00:19:04.350
Over there!

00:19:23.200 --> 00:19:25.180
Crap!  That she-devil!

00:19:56.380 --> 00:19:59.270
Shit!  Where did she go?  She vanished.

00:20:00.320 --> 00:20:01.740
There she is!

00:20:40.580 --> 00:20:43.320
There's nowhere else to go now.  Give it up.

00:21:02.020 --> 00:21:03.200
Chiko!

00:21:03.200 --> 00:21:04.720
You don't have to run by yourself.

00:21:05.250 --> 00:21:06.700
Ken-niichan!
